From a49bd7dffe2d3ed1016569e497c5254d93734341 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek <abhishek01789@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:58:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/40] Speak KDE's taskbar and plasma-shell protocols, start
 kglobalaccel

Add org_kde_plasma_window_management (v18) so the KDE taskbar lists,
groups and activates windows, and org_kde_plasma_shell (v8) so Kickoff,
tray popups and notifications sit where plasmashell asks, with no tiling
and no title bar. Start kglobalacceld on its X11 backend before
plasmashell, so Kickoff gets its shortcut and Super can open it.
